### CSS
Next, we'll style the HTML to achieve the underlining effect with multiple lines and different colors.

```css
/* styles.css */
.underline {
    display: inline-block;
}

.word {
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-right: 10px;
